POST http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Silva",
  "cpf": "11144477735",
  "profissionalId": 1,
  "data": "2026-08-03",
  "hora": "10:00"
}

### Horário inventado - não existe na agenda (deve dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Silva",
  "cpf": "11144477735",
  "profissionalId": 1,
  "data": "2026-08-03",
  "hora": "23:59"
}
